WEBVTT

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.175
♪ And I would be a dreamer ♪ 
(dan aku ingin bermimpi)

00:09:01.175 --> 00:09:04.640
♪ but my dream ♪ 
(tapi mimpiku)

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:08.251
♪ is slightly too big ♪ 
(terlampau besar)

00:09:08.251 --> 00:09:11.840
♪ for this space ♪ 
(untuk tempat ini)

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.777
♪ And I would be an angel ♪ 
(dan aku ingin menjadi malaikat)

00:09:15.777 --> 00:09:19.450
♪ but my halo ♪ 
(tapi lingkaran cahayaku)

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.886
♪ it pales in the glow ♪ 
(terlihat pucat di hadapan)

00:09:22.886 --> 00:09:26.407
♪ of your grace ♪ 
(sinar anugerahmu)

00:09:26.407 --> 00:09:30.164
♪ And I would be a joker ♪ 
(Dan aku ingin menjadi Joker)